s-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magma Caves</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magma Cave Shop</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$75,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.52.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Goblin Memorabilia</b> stands as a unique statue, exclusively available for purchase at the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Shop</a> nestled within the depths of the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a>.\n</p><p>However, acquiring this item isn't as straightforward as browsing a shelf. To obtain the Goblin Memorabilia, players must climb along the wooden beams positioned just above the store's entrance. Utilizing tools like the <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> is essential to access the higher points unreachable by standard jump height.\n</p><p>Upon climbing the beams you will encounter a small <b>Greedy Greeb Goblin</b> nestled within a small hole. Maneuvering into this hidden space, players will then navigate further, descending through another opening. Here, they'll discover multiple <b>Goblins</b> gathered around the statue. It can then be taken to the Store counter to be purchased for <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$75,000</span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>The Description of the Goblin Memorabilia is encoded. Upon decoding it with Base64, then shifting it a couple of times in Caesars Cipher until the following sentence was built: \n</p><p><i>According to all known laws of aviation, there is no way a  greedy greeb goblin should  be able to fly. Its wings are too small to get its fat little body of the ground. The greedy greeb goblin, of course, flies anyway, because greedy greeb goblins dont care what humans think is possible.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163255\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 61/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019494/10485760